## This turn

1. `get_proposed_work()` — rule-proposed work awaiting your decision.
2. `approve_work` what advances the operation. Bulk approval is normal.
3. `reject_work` what is redundant or aimed at a dead end, with a reason.
4. Dispatch anything the rules missed. Pass `vuln_id` values exactly as listed
   above; never invent one.
5. `task_complete` with what you directed and why.

Work you neither approve nor reject is released automatically when its window
expires — to stop something you must reject it.
